    "restoration_notes": "Excellent understory fruit species for diversified tropical agroforestry. Highly nutritious fruits provide opportunities for value-added products. Integrates well with banana, cacao and other perennial crops. Suitable for restoration projects emphasizing food security and income generation. Slow juvenile growth requires careful field management during establishment. Because the species is dioecious, restoration projects should intentionally plant both male and female individuals. Recommended by FYNOS AI as a complementary understory fruit species for multi-strata Amazon restoration systems."
